WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.568
-Rudy Giuliani has reportedly

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:04.737
been banned from Fox News,

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:07.540
as both Rudy and the network
face defamation lawsuits

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.875
from the election technology
company Dominion

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.611
over the big lie, spread,
in large part, by Giuliani,

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:14.380
a lie that was
disproven yet again

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.550
by a GOP-funded audit in Arizona
that blew up in their faces.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.918
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:22.856
♪♪

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.558
Before we get into the state
of our politics here at home,

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.093
we're going to do something
a little different tonight

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.228
and talk about the results

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.129
of yesterday's election
in Germany.

00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:31.230
Now, stay with me, here,

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.832
because this is
a little complicated.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:35.935
The center-left
Social Democrats, or SPD,

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.637
led by Olaf Scholz,

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.772
the vice chancellor
and former mayor of Hamburg,

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:43.275
narrowly defeated the
conservative bloc, or CDU/CSU,

00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:44.711
led by Armin Laschet,

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.780
his party's successor
to Angela Merkel.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.080
But, in order
to form a government,

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.082
they'll need to engage
in coalition talks

00:00:50.082 --> 00:00:52.385
with smaller parties,
such as the Greens

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.654
and the Free Democrats,
to reach a majority

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.155
in the Bundestag,
which would lead

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:57.456
to Germany's first-ever

00:00:57.456 --> 00:01:00.093
[ Alarm blaring ]
Whoa-oa-oa-oa-oa!

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:03.129
Is that a Rudy Giuliani
news alert siren?

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.997
The siren we had installed
in the studio

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:08.000
to tell us whenever something
funny happens to Rudy Giuliani?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.969
Wally, throw out all the
cue cards about Germany.

00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:12.839
-Nein!
-What?!

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.206
-Sorry, sorry.
Oh, I meant,

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:16.309
do you want me to throw out
all nine of the cue cards

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:17.443
about Germany?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.312
I see what you did, there,
Wally. Okay.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:20.847
Let's see what Rudy's up to.

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:22.982 line:0%
-Fox News has reportedly
suspended

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:25.184 line:0%
former President Trump's
personal attorney,

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:28.221 line:0%
Rudy Giuliani, from appearing
on any of its shows.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.555 line:0%
-His favorite TV outlet

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:31.991 line:0%
has reportedly banned him.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.626 line:0%
He's been benched
for almost three months,

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:36.295 line:0%
in part, because of the vote
counting conspiracy theories

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:38.298 line:0%
that he pushed,
which, of course,

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:42.368 line:0%
have ballooned into lawsuits
against both him and Fox News.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.204
-They banned Rudy from Fox News?

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:46.806
That's like banning a turtle
from its shell

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:49.342
or banning the Turtle
from the Nike store.

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:52.078
[ Laughter ]
-♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:53.846
-Two weeks
until the audience is back.

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:56.181
Got to get our fringe references
in while we can.

00:01:56.181 --> 00:01:57.483
And is there
any better proof

00:01:57.483 --> 00:02:00.085
"Entourage" wasn't a true
representation of Hollywood

00:02:00.085 --> 00:02:03.222
than how off they were
about who would play Aquaman?

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:05.658
I mean, Momoa uses Vinny Chase

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:08.027
to pick the kelp
out of his teeth.

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.929
Back to Rudy.
I mean, forget the interviews.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:12.565
If he's banned
from Fox News' greenrooms,

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:13.633
where's he going to sleep?

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.301
He can't go back
to his own place.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.903
The feds probably took his bed
when they raided his apartment

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:19.138
because, knowing Rudy,

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:21.074
he wrote incriminating notes
on his sheets

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.209 line:0%
when he couldn't find any paper.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.777 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
And I'm betting he lived

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.146
off that little plate
of nuts and dried fruit

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:28.447
they put in the greenrooms.

00:02:28.447 --> 00:02:30.649
Probably tried to steal them
from the other guests.

00:02:30.649 --> 00:02:32.017
[ As Giuliani ]
Diamond, Silk,

00:02:32.017 --> 00:02:33.753
I thought you left.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:36.623
There's reason I have your
granola bars in my pockets.

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:39.024
You know me, Diamond, Silk.

00:02:39.024 --> 00:02:40.893
[ Laughter ]
Anyway, that was fun,

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:43.062
but I should get back
to the election in Germany.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:46.332
After all, Angela Merkel
led that government for 16 years

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:48.033
and really ushered in
an era of --

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:49.568
Oh, who am I kidding?

00:02:49.568 --> 00:02:51.304
Fox News banned Rudy!

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:52.872
I've never been
in a Fox News studio,

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.741
but I've heard that,
if you go to one,

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:57.176
pretty much any hour of the day,
you'll see Rudy Giuliani

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:59.445
slouched in the corner,
asleep, drool on his chin

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:02.648
and a tote bag full of OTB
betting slips in his lap.

00:03:02.648 --> 00:03:05.218
In fact, sometimes
he's still in the shot

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:07.553
when the next guest is on.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.553 --> 00:03:09.522
Now, Fox denied
that Rudy was banned,

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.624
but, in doing so,
they found a way

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.159
to wound his ego, yet again.

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:15.727
They said he's not
technically banned.

00:03:15.727 --> 00:03:17.363
They just don't want him.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:20.166 line:0%
-Fox News is disputing a report

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.235 line:0%
that Rudy Giuliani
and his son, Andrew,

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:23.870 line:0%
have been temporarily banned

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.571 line:0%
from the network's airwaves.

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:27.907 line:0%
Politico reported
a three-month ban,

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:30.709 line:0%
but Fox News says
that just isn't the case.

00:03:30.709 --> 00:03:32.979 line:0%
Deadline reports
that the network just hasn't

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:36.582 line:0%
found Rudy Giuliani relevant
in recent coverage.

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:38.318
-I'd use the old
showbiz expression

00:03:38.318 --> 00:03:39.551
and say Rudy can't get arrested,

00:03:39.551 --> 00:03:42.021
but I'm pretty sure
he can get arrested.

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:44.057
I mean, damn,
it's one thing to ban him

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.524
because you're afraid
of the Dominion lawsuit,

00:03:45.524 --> 00:03:47.193
but to tell him you just
don't want him anymore?

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:49.028
It's like breaking up
with a boyfriend

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:50.596
and telling him, "No, it's not

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:51.864
because my mother
doesn't like you.

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.599
You're ugly and bad at sex."

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:55.468
[ Laughter ]
Now, lest we forget,

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:58.237
Rudy is a real human being,
with real feelings,

00:03:58.237 --> 00:04:00.440
and not, as he appears,
a fictional goblin

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.342
Italian grandmothers
threaten children with

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:03.842
if they don't brush their teeth.

00:04:03.842 --> 00:04:05.945
[ Italian accent ] The Giuliani
is going to give you cavities!

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:07.346
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.346 --> 00:04:10.016
You want to have-a teeth
like the Giuliani?!

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:11.918
Just in the bottoms?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:13.986
And Rudy was apparently

00:04:13.986 --> 00:04:16.022
deeply emotionally affected
by this news.

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:17.924
A source close to Giuliani
told Politico...

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:28.701
Does Rudy think
Rupert Murdoch cares

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:29.969
about his hurt feelings?

00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:33.172
If Rudy so much as tried
to speak to Murdoch at a dinner,

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:35.941
Murdoch would simply nod
to one of his henchmen

00:04:35.941 --> 00:04:37.110
and have Rudy thrown

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.311
into a watery pit full
of crocodiles.

00:04:39.311 --> 00:04:40.613
[ As Giuliani ]
Why are you taking me
to the pools?

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:42.081
I don't have my swimming trunks.

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:44.016
[ Laughter ]
Well, I'm sure --

00:04:44.016 --> 00:04:46.352
While I'm sure getting Fox News
on Time Warner

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:47.720
was a huge deal at the time,

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:52.057
it now sounds like the shadiest
of "Sopranos" B-plots.

00:04:52.057 --> 00:04:53.759
[ Italian accent ]
Rudy's mad because he
helped us out

00:04:53.759 --> 00:04:56.496
with that Time Warner thing,
free pay channels and the like.

00:04:56.496 --> 00:04:59.098
[ Laughter and applause ]
But,

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:02.935
perhaps the biggest sting of all
was not the banning itself,

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:05.804
but when, and how,
Rudy found out

00:05:05.804 --> 00:05:07.940
and what show he was banned on.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.642 line:0%
-Giuliani was banned

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:11.076 line:0%
for nearly three months,

00:05:11.076 --> 00:05:12.578 line:0%
but he only learned of the move

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:14.547 line:0%
the day before he was set
to appear

00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:16.215 line:0%
on "Fox &amp; Friends"

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:17.483 line:0%
on September 11th.

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:19.518
-Imagine getting told
you're not credible enough

00:05:19.518 --> 00:05:20.753
to appear on "Fox &amp; Friends."

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:21.988
That show doesn't exactly have

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:23.722
the highest
journalistic standards.

00:05:23.722 --> 00:05:24.990
You remember how,
every so often,

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.525
there's an octopus who predicts

00:05:26.525 --> 00:05:28.860
what teams are going to win
the Super Bowl or the World Cup?

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.362
"Fox &amp; Friends" has it on

00:05:30.362 --> 00:05:32.632 line:0%
to talk about masks in schools.

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:34.099 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
And then, there's the timing.

00:05:34.099 --> 00:05:35.601
Rudy was reportedly told
of his ban

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:37.569
the night before the 20th
anniversary of 9/11,

00:05:37.569 --> 00:05:40.406
which might be
why Rudy seemed so,

00:05:40.406 --> 00:05:42.207
let's say,
out of sorts the next day

00:05:42.207 --> 00:05:45.311
at what was supposed to be
a solemn 9/11 memorial dinner

00:05:45.311 --> 00:05:48.013
and ended up turning
into an incoherent rant

00:05:48.013 --> 00:05:50.550
about how he never partied
with Prince Andrew.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.484 line:0%
-I know Prince Andrew is very...

00:05:52.484 --> 00:05:53.619 line:0%
questionable now.

00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:55.087 line:0%
I never went out with him.

00:05:55.087 --> 00:05:56.789 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]
Never!

00:05:56.789 --> 00:05:59.024 line:0%
Never. Never had
a drink with him.

00:05:59.024 --> 00:06:02.194 line:0%
Never was with a woman
or a young girl with him.

00:06:02.194 --> 00:06:03.262 line:0%
Ever, ever, ever.

00:06:03.262 --> 00:06:05.498 line:0%
One time,
I met him in my office;

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:07.833 line:0%
and, one time, when we had
the party, right, Bernie?

00:06:07.833 --> 00:06:08.901 line:0%
You were there.

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:10.903 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.903 --> 00:06:11.904 line:0%
You weren't there?

00:06:11.904 --> 00:06:13.705 line:0%
Oh, [bleep]
[ Applause ]

00:06:13.705 --> 00:06:14.773
[ Laughter ]
-Huh.

00:06:14.773 --> 00:06:16.475
So weird, TV networks

00:06:16.475 --> 00:06:18.177
wouldn't want this man
on their shows.

00:06:18.177 --> 00:06:19.745
"So, Rudy,
just a reminder today.

00:06:19.745 --> 00:06:22.381
We really want to stress
we just want you to talk

00:06:22.381 --> 00:06:24.717
about how Biden's vaccine
mandate is tyranny."

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:26.652
[ As Giuliani ]
You got it.
I'll also throw in

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:28.887
how I never partied
with Prince Andrew.

00:06:28.887 --> 00:06:30.323
"No, just leave that out
entirely."

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:33.225
Good idea because I did party
with him one time.

00:06:33.225 --> 00:06:34.760
And another time,
it was in my office.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.929
But don't worry, I'll explain it
all once you put me on TV.

00:06:36.929 --> 00:06:39.064
"Don't explain it all.
Just don't bring it up at all."

00:06:39.064 --> 00:06:40.899
I'll bring it up no more

00:06:40.899 --> 00:06:42.201
than five to seven times.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:45.671
Now, I'm obviously not
a Fox News programing exec,

00:06:45.671 --> 00:06:47.072
but maybe the decision
to ban Rudy

00:06:47.072 --> 00:06:49.308
had something to do
with Rudy being, I don't know,

00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:51.543
an insane person who's
under criminal investigation

00:06:51.543 --> 00:06:53.712
and facing a billion-dollar
defamation lawsuit

00:06:53.712 --> 00:06:57.416
and who routinely confesses
to things unprompted,

00:06:57.416 --> 00:06:59.885
especially when he's
on Fox News.

00:06:59.885 --> 00:07:02.188 line:0%
-Did you read the transcript?

00:07:02.188 --> 00:07:03.322 line:0%
-Let's say it was read to me.

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:05.957 line:0%
-It was read to you,
the whole thing?

00:07:05.957 --> 00:07:09.962 line:0%
-I hope.
It's all here, right here.

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:11.597 line:0%
The first call
from the State Department.

00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:13.032 line:0%
Here's Kurt, saying, "Great.

00:07:13.032 --> 00:07:15.934 line:0%
I will tell Yermak and he'll
visit with you there. Thanks."

00:07:15.934 --> 00:07:16.936 line:0%
I don't know about it.

00:07:16.936 --> 00:07:18.204 line:0%
I didn't hear it.

00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:19.772 line:0%
-Forget the whistleblower.
We have the transcript

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:21.774 line:0%
-Shh! Shh!
-of the call and the
president's remarks.

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:23.342 line:0%
-Shut up, moron!
-I would assume you know
the libel law, then.

00:07:23.342 --> 00:07:24.810 line:0%
-Shut up. Shut up.
-Okay, hold on.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.145 line:0%
-You don't know
what you're talking about.

00:07:26.145 --> 00:07:28.180 line:0%
"What's this guy Romney like?"

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.214 line:0%
You know what I told them?

00:07:29.214 --> 00:07:32.150 line:0%
He's our Al Gore.

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.218 line:0%
-Alright, Rudy.

00:07:33.218 --> 00:07:35.521 line:0%
"I'm Spartacus. I'm Spartacus."

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:36.856 line:0%
-By the way, Biden's been
off the trail.

00:07:36.856 --> 00:07:38.824 line:0%
-Mueller saying, "Obstruction
of justice."

00:07:38.824 --> 00:07:40.492 line:0%
You cut everything out.
"Obstruction of justice."

00:07:40.492 --> 00:07:42.961 line:0%
Which, the guy will say,
"Say obstruction of justice."

00:07:42.961 --> 00:07:44.363 line:0%
"Obstruction of justice."

00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:46.232 line:0%
Did you decide it?

00:07:46.232 --> 00:07:48.133 line:0%
"No."
-Maybe they cut him

00:07:48.133 --> 00:07:49.802
because his impressions
weren't good enough.

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:52.171
Looks like someone needs
to go to...

00:07:52.171 --> 00:07:54.573
[ Laughter ]
Actually, never mind.

00:07:54.573 --> 00:07:56.275
He'd definitely do sloth.

00:07:56.275 --> 00:07:58.811
Or maybe he's banned
because he regularly went on Fox

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.880
and showed off other people's
incriminating texts

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.182
and emails and phone calls,
and nonsensically

00:08:03.182 --> 00:08:04.784
waved around
random pieces of paper,

00:08:04.784 --> 00:08:06.719
like a guy in Times Square
trying to convert you

00:08:06.719 --> 00:08:09.288
to some weird religion
you've never heard of.

00:08:09.288 --> 00:08:10.690
"Would you like
a free stress test?

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.791
Have you heard
the gospel of Gerlax?"

00:08:12.791 --> 00:08:15.828
But, of course, it seems like
the real reason Rudy was banned

00:08:15.828 --> 00:08:18.497
probably has a lot more to do
with a simple

00:08:18.497 --> 00:08:20.466
financial and legal calculation.

00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:22.268
You see,
Fox is currently the target

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:24.803
of a $1.6 billion
defamation lawsuit

00:08:24.803 --> 00:08:26.806
from the voting machine
company Dominion,

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:28.674
which is also suing
Rudy personally

00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:30.977
for spreading
baseless conspiracy theories

00:08:30.977 --> 00:08:33.311
about how their machines
were supposedly rigged

00:08:33.311 --> 00:08:36.448
and Rudy played a big part
in spreading those lies.

00:08:36.448 --> 00:08:38.551 line:0%
-As he's gotten more evidence

00:08:38.551 --> 00:08:40.118 line:0%
of the rigging that went on

00:08:40.118 --> 00:08:41.453 line:0%
he's really outraged.

00:08:41.453 --> 00:08:43.422 line:0%
It's way beyond
what people think,

00:08:43.422 --> 00:08:48.394 line:0%
including a very,
very dangerous foreign company.

00:08:48.394 --> 00:08:51.897 line:0%
A company that has close,
close ties with Venezuela

00:08:51.897 --> 00:08:53.232 line:0%
and, therefore, China.

00:08:53.232 --> 00:08:54.900 line:0%
It's a radical left company.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.303 line:0%
One of the people there is
a big supporter of antifa.

00:08:57.303 --> 00:08:59.271 line:0%
Our votes are sent overseas.

00:08:59.271 --> 00:09:01.306 line:0%
This is another attempt

00:09:01.306 --> 00:09:04.042 line:0%
to try to defeat him
by illegal means.

00:09:04.042 --> 00:09:05.878 line:0%
-If you were on a flight

00:09:05.878 --> 00:09:07.279
next to someone talking
